{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_02",
  "title": "First Round",
  "storyCode": "DH-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d5b8bce13cea730d41725e5d441c7a621f06252be48a56362e4f15b32a996bb3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Welcome, dear audience, to the eve of your mightily awaited Eighth Dossoles Warrior Champion!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Before we part the curtains, why don't we invite our beloved Mayor Candela up for the opening speech?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Citizens, tourists, with great pride in this city, I welcome you to Dossoles!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It doesn't matter where you're from. It doesn't matter who you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've made it here, so let all that fall away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enjoy everything our city has to give you. Enjoy everything you deserve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Be happy, laugh happy, shout and scream happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is the paradise I built, and it's all for you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now come! The most unforgettable time of your life is here for the taking!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay, big thank-you to Mayor Candela for that speech, just as sempiternally scorched with passion, alright. Moving on, time to introduce your contestants."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lots of familiar faces this year and last year, but plenty of new ones too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "First order of business, they look like a lovey-dovey couple, they ARE a lovey-dovey couple, but they're a force on the fighting front!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Honey Summer!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Male Tourist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_201",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The power of love brought us together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sluggish Female Tourist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_202",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The power of love brought us our love."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male & Female Tourist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_201",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The power of our love is unmatched!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even I can barely stand before that sparkly power of love! Let's see just how far love's legs can run!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Solo unit up next, the contestant who won the Stomach King Prelims, Mizuki!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Harmless as he looks, he ate through an entire restaurant warehouse. That bottomless stomach and that blue hair are begging to synergize with the ocean here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pacer-man!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hallo, hallo, hey everyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Contestant Mizuki, would you like to say a few words to stir the hearts of the people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm... I'll eat you all up once I'm tired of playing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ooooh! Contestant Mizuki, utterer of terrifying statements in completely normal voices! We look forward to seeing you out there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Next up, it's a local team, led by Miss Rafaela, who may look cute, but she's got a giant, fiendish sickle. That's the kind of contrast this team's here to feed you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's welcome up—the Grey Feathers!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rafaela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_421_laplum_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hello to you all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Rafaela, what do you have to say before the tournament?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rafaela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_421_laplum_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um... I'll do my best."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ooh, alright, alright, sometimes it's the simple things that touch us deep! Grey Feathers, I think you'll go far!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right after that, it's a newcomer to this competition, but the team that's drawn the most buzz!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're the live scrimmage gatecrashers, winners with an attitude no-one could answer, the supernovas who've picked up Mr. Pancho's support!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They came from a place the City of Two Suns loves dearly—the Lungmen heroines, Miss Lin Yühsia, Miss Ch'en Hui-chieh, and we even get the local arms dealer, Mr. Ernesto, completing this team—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—LUNG wRATh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Strong, fresh teams spike an appetite like nothing else, and their odds are sitting high! But! Do you truly dare to put your chips down on them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Sigh*."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hah."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, let's get your statement. Team leader?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who's the leader?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ernesto, you do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's no way Lin Yühsia's going to take what I say."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And you wouldn't take what I say either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Er, alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In that case, we proclaim—we're going to carve our mark into this competition's history!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How was that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mediocre."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Agreed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thought so."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Massively assertive! Let's look forward to LUNG wRATh and their vivid display."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Moving on, our next team is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, Missy, this way."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Coming! Hey, watch my ice cream!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Really, this crowd is insane..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just goes to show how much attention's on this contest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anyway, you see that? Ch'en's carrying some gun-ish thing for some reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guess she's not planning to use her sword this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's set herself up badly, hasn't she? She was about as good at firearms training as I was."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow. Excellence doesn't just grow on trees, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Calling her swordsmanship 'excellent' undersells it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, Missy, I gotta say, you're an even bigger Ch'en fan than me, behind her back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm just stating facts, okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah. More importantly, though, seeing Ch'en without a sword is a sight to treasure. Let's go ask the organizers if we can get a recording of this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's not. That would be hell."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's to be so embarrassed about? We'll cut it into a flick. I've already got the title. It'll be 'Gunslinger Old Ch'en Grasps Great Lung Power.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I gotta say, you might have a talent for directing awful B movies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm flattered. Oh, right, Missy. I've got something to talk to you about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "C'mon, I haven't even said what it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You said 'something to talk about' and I nearly threw up my ice cream. Nothing good comes out of that phrasing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey. No, just, I saw the officials here had an event on for the spectators."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I looked into it. They let you guess who'll win. And there's a bunch of smaller ones, like who'll be first to get gold, who'll get eliminated earliest, and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The way you use the word 'guess' absolutely floors me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's government-sponsored. Ship-shape and legal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh. What even goes for illegal in this city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah... good point, but right now we're just regular tourists, y'know? It's beyond our job descriptions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And look, even if you want to laugh at Ch'en and Miss Lin, just suppose they do win, we won't be out of pocket, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Makes it a win-win, Missy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sigh*... I give in. Here's my card."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mighty thanks, Milady."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't go splashing it about!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
