    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, that's all forty teams."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Cameras and drones will capture the whole thing, ensuring you don't miss a single beautiful shot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And this main stage isn't gonna stand alone, either. The officials have set up ten more, each one with its own dedicated presenter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you'll get every second, and with commentary just as brilliant to match."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Plus, once the opening ceremony begins, we've got a little wagering opportuntiy for you audience-siders, to make the competition that much spicier."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All spectators are invited to register your info on the government site, and you can make yourself a little extra cash!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "For specifics on how it'll work, refer to your government-issued competition guides."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, then. All the competitors are in our starting district and readied up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Round 1 will be a search—and a struggle—for pure gold in a partitioned-off area. Teams will then hand it directly to staff at the finish point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, they're also allowed to shoot for more! Whatever gold they get belongs to them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright! Mayor Candela, fire off the salute and signal the start of this competition!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I declare—Round 1 has officially begun!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What now?"
